{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot; is a puzzle adventure game where you hack into the world's system and embark on an adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a small debugging AI and explore the digital world alongside a talkative navigation AI!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack into a glitched system and reconnect its broken code!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Program, battle rogue AIs, and sometimes\u2026 even reconnect hearts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel between the real world and the puzzle world to uncover the secrets of the digital realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026And what kind of ending awaits you at the end of your journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Hack into the system and explore\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you infiltrate the system, its insides appear as puzzle-like electronic circuits.<br>Solve puzzles to restore the system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/TrashGif.gif?t=1742014114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Intuitive programming puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s biggest feature is how anyone can experience programming easily.<br>Simply connect code to build logic and enjoy the fun of programming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/PuzzleGif.gif?t=1742014114\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Thrilling puzzle-action battles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AIs affected by heart glitches go rogue and attack.<br>Engage in heart-pounding puzzle-action battles to bring them back under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/BattleGif.gif?t=1742014114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010A story about connecting hearts\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sci-fi narrative inspired by modern society and working AIs.<br>Can you dive deep into the circuits of the heart? The ending is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/SS_6.jpg?t=1742014114\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now, embark on an adventure to fix the world's bugs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949960?t=1742014114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742014114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/7a724eb2e60448ed56c30dd126fc44780473c0e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742014114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/7a724eb2e60448ed56c30dd126fc44780473c0e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742014114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot; is a puzzle adventure game where you hack into the world's system and embark on an adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a small debugging AI and explore the digital world along